Why you saw javax.management.AttributeNotFoundException

Those long traces earlier (JDBCSystemResource:JdbcResource etc.) are normal warnings. They happen because WLST tries to access attributes not present in some system datasources/adapters. You can wrap those lookups in try/except: to silence them (you already did in parts of the script).

